# Feed the Swarm: "Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal to that permanent's
# mana value." Bot2's Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) is destroyed and Bot1 loses exactly 1 life (20 -> 19). The refusals
# beside it: Bot1's own creature is not a legal target ("an opponent controls") and neither is a noncreature
# nonenchantment permanent (Mox Emerald); the Elves, a creature an opponent controls, is the positive control for both.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Feed the Swarm
Faerie Dreamthief
Mox Jet
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Emerald
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faerie Dreamthief.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(Swamp |)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
! Bot1.Hand.Feed the Swarm.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Faerie Dreamthief)
! Bot1.Hand.Feed the Swarm.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Hand.Feed the Swarm.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald
Bot1.Battlefield = Faerie Dreamthief; Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard = Feed the Swarm; Black Lotus
